# Packaging is an include list. `**` drops everything, and the negations below
# add back the runtime surface. vsce has no way to express an exclusion for the
# package.json `files` property, and `.vscodeignore` cannot be combined with it.
**
!dist/**
!resources/**
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!SUPPORT.md
!LICENSE

# Webview assets are matched by extension instead of `media/**` so the Webview
# sourcemaps stay out of the package: `media/` holds 3.3 MB of lazy grammar
# chunks and 5.1 MB of maps that the Webview never requests. Maps remain in the
# local build output for DevTools.
!media/*.js
!media/*.css
!media/*.html
!media/*.woff
!media/*.woff2
!media/*.ttf
!media/**/*.js
!media/**/*.css
